# ReceiptPilot backend configuration
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is OPTIONAL. When set, POST /api/extract uses Claude vision
# to extract receipt fields from the uploaded image. When it is absent, the
# server falls back to randomized mock extraction so the app still works end to
# end with no key configured.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your key to enable real AI extraction.
# Never commit your real `.env`.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: port the Express API listens on (default 3001).
# PORT=3001
